<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Snøhetta from Snøheim — Snøheim–Gamle Reinheim–Snøhetta Stortoppen–return</name><desc>Follow the marked normal ascent from Snøheim across the Stridåi footbridge, past Gamle Reinheim and up the east ridge to Snøhetta Stortoppen. Return by the same route. The climbing traverse across the other summits is excluded.

